{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/491805/", "pk": 491805, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/", "pk": 60827, "shortname": "realfloridaadventures", "name": "Real Florida Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Kennedy Space Center Direct Express", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Kennedy Space Center Direct Express", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 5421, "description": "#Kennedy Space Center Direct Express\n\n##Duration\n\nApprox. 10.5 Hours\n\n## About This Tour\n\nOne Pickup, One Drop Off.  Leave directly from the Orlando Starflyer at ICON Park and be the first drop off at the end of the day!  Direct Express both there and back!\n\nWelcome to the home of One Small Step for Man. In simple terms, this is one of the most essential – and thrilling – attractions in Florida, and it is as real as it comes in terms of a dynamic, visceral place to visit.\n\nNot only does the Space Center offer the past, present and future of the space program, it puts visitors front and center in the whole experience like never before. Seeing is believing, and you *will* believe you have been transported to the cutting edge of space exploration through a series of hands-on exhibits, movies, and presentations, including a daily Astronaut Encounter with one of the modern heroes of NASA’s operations.\n\nIt all starts with the signature Bus Tour that provides a complete overview of the full extent of the vast spread of operations, including the massive Vehicle Assembly Building, Launch Complex 39B, and the Apollo/Saturn V Center, with its recreated moon landing and awesome full-size Saturn V rocket.\n\nBack at the main Visitor Complex, you should definitely make a beeline for the hugely impressive Space Shuttle Atlantis exhibit, with its moving and emotional presentation of one of the four surviving orbiters, as well as take a ride on the riveting Shuttle Launch Experience, a clever simulator with the inside track on what it feels like to blast off from the Space Center. \n\nYou can also visit the Heroes & Legends center (including the U.S. Astronaut Hall of Fame), soak up the grandeur of the IMAX Theater with its eye-popping large-screen movies, and wander the Rocket Garden.\n\nThere is SO much to see here, you will definitely need all day to take it all in, and our Admission with Transportation is the perfect way to indulge your inner astronaut! The KSC is fully 60 miles from Orlando, so let us take the strain out of the journey and you can enjoy the experience to the max – the IMAX.\n\n\n**Inclusions**\n•\tAdmission into Kennedy Space Center Visitors complex \n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tGratuities\n•\tDrinks\n•\tMeals\n\n\n##Pickup Time and Schedule\n\n**Orlando Star Flyer at Icon Park** at 8am \n*8265 International Dr, Orlando, FL 32819*", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "We look forward to seeing you soon!\n\n#Kennedy Space Center with Transportation\n\n**Inclusions**\n•\tAdmission into Kennedy Space Center Visitors complex \n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tDrinks\n•\tMeals\n\n#**Gratuities**\nYour tour guides gratuities are NOT included in the cost of your tour package.  Although, not compulsory, tipping is expected and is an expression of your satisfaction with the people who have assisted you throughout your tour.  Although it may not be customary to you, it is of considerable significance to the tour guide who will take care of you for the entire day.  As a guide for you, based upon the cost of the tour booked:\n**10% - $12 | 15% - $18 | 20% - $24  (suggested gratuities are per person)**\n\n##What to bring\nSunscreen, Sunglasses, Camera’s, Proof of Confirmation or voucher, cash for optional gratuities,", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "All ages • Approx. 10.5 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/491805/images/1043902/", "pk": 1043902, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XtEGucCaQElaGbmkx6re", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XtEGucCaQElaGbmkx6re", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/491805/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XtEGucCaQElaGbmkx6re", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XtEGucCaQElaGbmkx6re", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/491805/images/1043905/", "pk": 1043905, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_ur